            "Simulates a plausible medical study for teaching: a clinical scenario from the library, a study design compatible with its outcome, a sample size and some realism. The dataset opens in a new window; the answer key holds the true parameters and what the design is expected to estimate.": [
                "Simula un estudi mèdic plausible per a la docència: un escenari clínic de la biblioteca, un disseny compatible amb la seva variable resposta, una mida mostral i una mica de realisme. Les dades s'obren en una finestra nova; la clau de respostes conté els paràmetres veritables i el que el disseny hauria d'estimar."
            ],
            "Simulates one scenario under several study designs from the same superpopulation (same seed and student key) and compares what each design estimates, with its 95% confidence interval, against the true values. The studies can be opened as one dataset with a design column.": [
